  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      108.51,
      562.83,
      478.88,
      575.01
    ],
    "text": "NATIONAL MEDICINES REGULATORY AUTHORITY ACT, No. 5 OF 2015",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      11.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      48.05,
      587.73,
      541.9,
      610.79
    ],
    "text": "REGULATIONS made by the Minister of Health, Nutrition and Indigenous Medicine under section 142 of the National Medicines Regulatory Authority Act, No.5 of 2015 read with sections 3 and 118 of the aforesaid Act.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      48.05,
      623.73,
      530.16,
      670.79
    ],
    "text": "Dr. RAJITHA SENARATNE, Minister of Health, Nutrition and Indigenous Medicine.Colombo, 29th August, 2018.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      265.9,
      684.03,
      321.52,
      696.21
    ],
    "text": "Regulations",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      11.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      84.05,
      708.93,
      445.8,
      719.99
    ],
    "text": "1. These Regulations may be cited as the Medicines (Tender Pricing) Regulations of 2018.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      48.05,
      732.93,
      541.96,
      755.99
    ],
    "text": "2. There shall be a maximum price limit to determine the maximum tender prices (hereinafter referred to as the \u201cMTP\u201d) of the drugs speci\ufb01 ed in the Schedule hereto (hereinafter referred to as the \u201cScheduled drugs\u201d).",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      48.05,
      496.61,
      84.16,
      507.68
    ],
    "text": "09-322/1",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      67.12,
      83.41,
      546.43,
      103.65
    ],
    "text": "5I fldgi ( ^I& fPoh - YS% ,xld m%cd;dka;s%l iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h - 2018'08'31PART I : SEC. (I) - GAZETTE EXTRA ORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA - 31.08.2018",
    "fonts": [
      "FMAbabldBold",
      "MinionPro-Regular",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      5.599999904632568,
      8.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      55.27,
      118.61,
      549.8,
      143.68
    ],
    "text": "3. The MTP limits in respect of the scheduled drugs shall also be applicable to all brand names, generic names, dosage forms and strengths of the Scheduled drugs.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      55.27,
      160.61,
      549.79,
      213.68
    ],
    "text": "4. No manufacturer, importer, trader, distributor, or any other person shall place bid for any procurement or quote for any other emergency purchase of any scheduled drugs as speci\ufb01 ed in Column II of the Schedule, for a price above the maximum tender price as speci\ufb01 ed in Column V thereof on and after the date on which these regulations come in to operation.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      55.27,
      230.61,
      549.8,
      269.68
    ],
    "text": "5. No governmental or semi-governmental institution shall accept any tender or make any emergency purchase of any scheduled drugs as speci\ufb01 ed in Column II of the Schedule, for a price above the maximum tender price as speci\ufb01 ed in Column V thereof from the date on which these regulations come in to operation.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      55.27,
      286.61,
      549.79,
      325.68
    ],
    "text": "6. For the purpose of procurement or emergency purchase, where any dosage form or strength of the Scheduled drugs are not speci\ufb01 ed in such Schedule, the maximum price limit for such dosage forms or strengths shall be \ufb01 xed by the National Medicines Regulatory Authority.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      55.27,
      342.61,
      549.81,
      381.68
    ],
    "text": "7. Notwithstanding the provisions of the preceding regulations, the maximum tender price of each such unit of the Scheduled drugs as speci\ufb01 ed in the Schedule shall be effective on and after the date of operation of these regulations until revised.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      55.27,
      398.61,
      549.79,
      423.68
    ],
    "text": "8. Any person or institution who or which contravenes the provisions of these regulations commits an offence under the National Medicines Regulatory Authority Act, No.5 of 2015, and shall be triable under Part IV of the said Act.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      273.75,
      443.81,
      328.76,
      454.88
    ],
    "text": "SCHEDULE",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
