    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 5,
    "bbox": [
      48.05,
      531.24,
      530.16,
      578.31
    ],
    "text": "Dr. RAJITHA SENARATNE, Minister of Health, Nutrition and Indigenous Medicine.Colombo, 29th August, 2018.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 5,
    "bbox": [
      268.54,
      591.24,
      319.1,
      602.31
    ],
    "text": "Regulations",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 5,
    "bbox": [
      48.05,
      615.54,
      542.17,
      688.11
    ],
    "text": "1. These regulations may be cited as the Medical Devices (Pricing) Regulations, of 2018. 2. No manufacturer, importer, distributor, trader, provider, pharmacist, medical practitioner, a medical institution inclusive of a private medical institution or a person who is in possession of a medical device shall sell, offer for sale or charge for any medical device set out in the Schedule hereto, described by any brand name, approved name, models, sizes or pack sizes, above the Maximum Retail Price (MRP) stipulated therein.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 5,
    "bbox": [
      48.05,
      701.64,
      542.17,
      761.91
    ],
    "text": "3. A manufacturer, importer, distributor, trader, provider, pharmacist, medical practitioner, a medical institution inclusive of a private medical institution or a person who is in possession of a medical device set out in the Schedule hereto, currently sells the said medical device at a price less than the maximum retail price set out in the Schedule hereto, is required to maintain the existing price without any price increase.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 5,
    "bbox": [
      55.0,
      122.7,
      405.66,
      160.17
    ],
    "text": "Column IColumn IIGeneric NameColumn IIIRoute of Administration/ dosage form",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 5,
    "bbox": [
      420.61,
      122.7,
      532.24,
